      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, the self care stuff feels like such a joke when the math just doesn't work. like i can meditate all i want but it doesn't pay the landlord or stop the interest from piling up. it feels less like a \"struggle\" and more like a mathematical certainty that i'm going to drown. it's just a math problem at this point and the numbers are always going to be in the red. i feel like i'm just waiting for the inevitable.",
