    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"money concern\" though. it's the fact that even if i work ten times harder, the ceiling is still there. i'm staring at a future where i'm just older, more tired, and even more in debt. it feels like the world is built to keep us in this loop until we just stop. like, why is the default setting for existence such a constant state of deficit? it feels like the only way to actually solve a problem like this is to just... exit the equation.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
